      "presentation": {
        "description": "Fighter is a Strength-based Martial Defender. Use tactical cunning and battle prowess to contain the enemy and protect your allies. \"Stickiest\" Defender; hard for enemies to escape you. Variety of build options based on preferred weapon loadout. High damage for a Defender and king of the opportunity attack.\n\n[Test-only presentation override; mechanics unchanged.]",
